[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 1.2 System overview

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SUM-001-MILUAV
TITLE: System Overview
STATEMENT: The Military Quad Copter RTOS provides autonomous flight control, mission management, and secure communication for military UAV operations.
RATIONALE: System overview provides context for user operations.

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 1.3 Document overview

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SUM-002-MILUAV
TITLE: Document Structure
STATEMENT: This document covers system capabilities, referenced documents, user instructions, and operational procedures per MIL-STD-498.
RATIONALE: Structured documentation supports user training and operations.

[[/SECTION]]

